      "source": [
        "### 2. Modelni takomillashtirish (Optimization)\n",
        "\n",
        "Ushbu bo'limda quyidagilarni amalga oshiramiz:\n",
        "1. **Epochlar sonini oshirish**: 5 tadan 20 taga.\n",
        "2. **Learning Rate**: `Adam` optimizatorida `learning_rate=0.001` ni qo'llaymiz.\n",
        "3. **Arxitekturani murakkablashtirish**: Neyronlar sonini (256 va 128) ko'paytiramiz."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "c9b5f031",
        "outputId": "9656c8b5-45d8-40a7-8535-357067d4ed24"
      },
      "source": [
        "import tensorflow as tf\n",
        "from tensorflow.keras import layers, models\n",
        "\n",
        "def build_optimized_model(activation_fn, lr=0.001):\n",
        "    model = models.Sequential([\n",
        "        layers.Input(shape=(28, 28)),\n",
        "        layers.Flatten(),\n",
        "        layers.Dense(256, activation=activation_fn),\n",
        "        layers.Dense(128, activation=activation_fn),\n",
        "        layers.Dense(10, activation='softmax')\n",
        "    ])\n",
        "\n",
        "    optimizer = tf.keras.optimizers.Adam(learning_rate=lr)\n",
        "    model.compile(optimizer=optimizer,\n",
        "                  loss='sparse_categorical_crossentropy',\n",
        "                  metrics=['accuracy'])\n",
        "    return model\n",
        "\n",
        "# Modelni yaratish\n",
        "optimized_model = build_optimized_model('relu', lr=0.001)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Optimallashtirilgan model o'qitilmoqda...\")\n",
        "# History ob'ektini olish uchun fit funksiyasini to'liq bajarish kerak\n",
        "opt_history = optimized_model.fit(\n",
        "    x_train, y_train,\n",
        "    epochs=20,\n",
        "    validation_split=0.1,\n",
        "    verbose=1\n",
        ")"
      ],
